			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule for URI lifecycle and browser view preparation\n\nUpdate the Element git submodule from 4b0d889a to 70e79155 to synchronize the latest revisions for Mountain and Wind on the Current branch.\n\n**Mountain:** Implement gRPC notification handlers for `UnregisterExternalUriOpener` and `UnregisterRemoteAuthorityResolver` within the Vine protocol. These handlers leverage existing `UnregisterByHandle` utilities to ensure consistent lifecycle management for remote authority and URI opener extensions.\n\n**Wind:** Expand the `StubChannels` registry in `TauriMainProcessService` to include definitions for the `browserViewGroup` service. Add stubs for `updateKeybindings`, `updateTheme`, `updateConfiguration`, `getBrowserViews`, and dev tools commands to establish the contract for upcoming native browser view operations.\n\nThese changes ensure full lifecycle support for extension URI handlers and lay the groundwork for advanced view management in the Workbench service layer.",
			"SHA": "c4db0cd318e34bd96e288b5ebc3e0322026b03e7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
