			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				133,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule for URI robustness in Cocoon and Sky\n\nUpdate the Element git submodule to commit 4b0d889a, addressing URI reconstruction issues across the gRPC bridge and Source Control Manager layers.\n\n**Cocoon:** Replace reliance on default `.toString()` and `.external` properties with explicit structural checks for `scheme`, `authority`, and `path`. This ensures valid URI strings are constructed and transmitted to Mountain, preventing malformed requests in document and notification flows.\n\n**Sky:** Refine URI parsing in `InstallScm.ts` to distinguish custom URI stringification from default `Object.prototype` methods. This prevents generic objects from triggering false positives during immediate service execution, aligning with the simplified bridge logic.\n\nThese changes restore stability in file access, language provider invocations, and source control operations by guaranteeing accurate type handling and robust request routing.",
			"SHA": "09652f8f2c47a788f358a6e272d24e5c27e5d006"
		},
		{
